        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Patka (court girdle or sash) of embroidered muslin with silk and silver-gilt threads. Semi-transparent ground, ends and borders embroidered in pink, red and green silk, in satin stitch, and with details in silver-gilt thread. The pattern is a row of six flower stylised sprays. Border of scrolling stems and flower-heads similar to those in the sprays."@en ;
